SparkFlow bundles the upstream Python backend, providers, strategies and report
templates unchanged. Its React frontend, scheduler, desktop application and
GitHub workflows are not used. The integration lives in
scripts/stock-strategy-worker.py and server/stockStrategy.ts.
SparkFlow's public US quote/history/financial and RSS news adapters live in
scripts/stock_strategy_data.py and scripts/stock_strategy_news.py. These are
installed at runtime without editing the upstream modules.
